<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA PLZEN DETAILS 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA PLZEN DETAILS 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The massive Czech engineering</p>
<p>conglomerate Skoda a.s. said combined 1996 pre-tax profit of</p>
<p>the parent company and all of its wholly owned subsidiaries</p>
<p>totalled 366.7 million crowns, according to filings with the</p>
<p>Prague Stock Exchange obtained on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figures do not contain results from any of Skoda's</p>
<p>numerous partially-owned subsidiaries, including truck makers</p>
<p>Liaz and Tatra, where Skoda owns controlling stakes.</p>
<p>Those were not disclosed in the PSE filings, making a</p>
<p>comparison with 1995 results impossible.</p>
<p>Below is a list of companies' profit and loss reports</p>
<p>delivered to the Prague Stock Exchange. No further results were</p>
<p>immediately available.</p>
<p>=============================================================</p>
<p>									  profit</p>
<p>  (in 000's crowns)		revenue	   costs    /loss</p>
<p> SKODA Hute			  2,738,231     2,734,590   3,641</p>
<p> SKODA Kovarny		     2,280,134     2,260,547  19,587</p>
<p> SKODA Tezke strojirenstvi     1,985,916     1,984,855   1,061</p>
<p> SKODA Jaderne strojirenstvi   5,850,166     5,747,720 102,446</p>
