<p> SKODA Hotely			   31,613	  31,496     117</p>
<p> SKODA Trading		     2,333,627     2,315,913  17,714</p>
<p> SKODA Gastro			  160,244	 159,234   1,010</p>
<p> SKODA Internal servis		56,154	  54,318   1,836</p>
