<p>SKODA a.s.</p>
<p> Executive/management services 1,608,531     1,653,875 -45,344</p>
<p>==============================================================</p>
<p>Total SKODA a.s. plus all</p>
<p> fully-owned subsidiaries     31,572,079   31,205,362  366,717</p>
<p>==============================================================</p>
<p>Note. Comparative results for the previous year at each</p>
<p>subsidiary was not provided. The company in its 1995 annual</p>
<p>report said its total consolidated gross result showed a 166.31</p>
<p>million crown loss, and a net loss of 432.19 million crowns.</p>
<p>It did not list exactly which of its holdings were excluded</p>
<p>in the consolidated figures.</p>
<p>Skoda a.s. is an engineering and holding company based in</p>
<p>the western Czech city of Plzen. It is not affiliated with the</p>
<p>auto maker Skoda Automobilova a.s.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
